# Plugin-host = the app's requirements + the Python half of Playwright.
# Compiled to requirements-plugin-host.lock; see gdx_dispatch/tools/requirements_lock.py.
-r requirements.txt

# The Playwright base image (Dockerfile.plugin-host, v1.49.1-noble) ships the
# browsers under /ms-playwright but NOT the Python package. Pinned to the base
# image's browser build (chromium-1148): a different playwright would look for
# a browser the image does not carry. Change this and the FROM tag together;
# tests/test_requirements_lock.py fails when they differ.
# playwright 1.49.1 requires greenlet==3.1.1 exactly, so this lock pins greenlet
# lower than the app lock does.
playwright==1.49.1
